ot for you and friends on a night."},{"business_id":"r2IuwdvmEZycvudboTNg7A","review_id":"WhpvawgO6xHCKlzU0PDRWA","date":"2015-06-22T14:14:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9186792969703674,"text_excerpt":"this is a perfect little hookah bar, i wish i had known about it sooner. our server was so nice and did everything to make us comfortable. we got some appetizers and drinks, but we really loved the hookah! their fruity mint flavors were so good. the atmosphere was very chill, a nice change from the busyness of new orleans. great experience!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"r2IuwdvmEZycvudboTNg7A","photo_id":"1WCxTuXvnwgT4DbXqKklIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1WCxTuXvnwgT4DbXqKklIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9141334295272827},{"business_id":"r2IuwdvmEZycvudboTNg7A","photo_id":"OErHOvCKimwjWStpvhEcVA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OErHOvCKimwjWStpvhEcVA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9141333699226379}]},"notebook_case":null}
